     "body": "<p>I have applied Swithun's patch in principle, although not the case specific parts, and I have chosen to send all user attributes to the SearchResultFilteringDemoImpl, not just fedoraRoles.</p>\n\n<p>See <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/gsearch/commit/0cdb26dd40b59ebc3a9fdb94bf650f927c616bdd\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/gsearch/commit/0cdb26dd40b59ebc3a9fdb94bf650f927c616bdd</a></p>",
     "created": "14/Nov/11 10:37 AM",
