  "description": "<p>Filtering of search results by access constraints.</p>\n\n<p>This was part of the plan in <a href=\"https://conferences.tdl.org/or/OR2011/OR2011main/paper/view/416/127\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://conferences.tdl.org/or/OR2011/OR2011main/paper/view/416/127</a> for GSearch 2.4.<br/>\nBased on work presented at OR2008 : <a href=\"http://pubs.or08.ecs.soton.ac.uk/104/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://pubs.or08.ecs.soton.ac.uk/104/</a> <br/>\nProblem: Search results contain hits that the user does not have the access rights to see <br/>\nSolution: Extend access rights to search results by filtering</p>",
